WEBVTT

00:09:59.676 --> 00:10:01.676
nor do I think bigger ears will help.

00:10:01.796 --> 00:10:02.796
(Laughter)

00:10:03.156 --> 00:10:07.636
But we can shape-shift
our cities and our towns,

00:10:07.636 --> 00:10:10.796
and we can change the way
that we cool ourselves down

00:10:10.796 --> 00:10:14.316
and we can change the way
that we keep our medicines and food safe.

00:10:14.796 --> 00:10:15.796
Thank you.

00:10:15.796 --> 00:10:16.796
(Applause and cheers)

00:10:16.796 --> 00:10:20.156
(Applause)